OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for mural of WW2 hero on
OL,4,Acouncil building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council hopes to paint a mural on the
OL,7,Fside of a town hall in memory of the
OL,8,FUK's oldest surviving Second World War
OL,9,Fveteran who died at the age of 110.
OL,11,FDonald Rose served as a sniper in the
OL,12,FQueen's Royal Regiment and survived a
OL,13,Fbullet to the leg during the D-Day
OL,14,Flandings.
OL,16,FErewash Borough Council has now
OL,17,Fsubmitted plans for the
OL,18,Fseven-metre-tall artwork at Ilkeston
OL,19,FTown Hall in memory of Rose, who died
OL,20,Flast July.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
