OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for mural of WW2 hero on
OL,4,Acouncil building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council report recommending approval
OL,7,Fsaid the mural would promote
OL,8,Fremembrance and celebrate Rose's
OL,9,F"extraordinary life and service", while
OL,10,Frecognising the contribution of all
OL,11,Fmembers of the Armed Forces.
